      <h2>Migration checklist</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Export sender identity, purpose-specific permission and current consent state; suppress recent purchasers</li>
        <li>Rebuild abandoned cart with holdout cohort</li>
        <li>Document collision rules with welcome/SMS, queued-message ownership and replay deduplication</li>
        <li>Inventory-aware suppressions before discounts</li>
        <li>Margin review at day 30 post-cutover</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Rejoiner describes native Shopify connectivity and segmentation for exclusions; verify the required events and service scope in your account before switching. See <a class="link" href="https://www.rejoiner.com/products/email-marketing">Rejoiner email features</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.rejoiner.com/pricing">platform and service options</a>.</p>
      <h2>Ranked alternatives</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-lg font-bold">
        <li><a class="link" href="/compare/sequenzy-vs-klaviyo">Sequenzy</a> — The lean lifecycle layer for Shopify stores that need strategy, not another blank canvas.</li>
        <li><a class="link" href="/alternatives/recart-alternative">Recart</a> — Mobile-first cart recovery specialization.</li>
        <li><a class="link" href="/alternatives/postscript-alternative">Postscript</a> — SMS-native recovery and campaigns for Shopify DTC.</li>
        <li><a class="link" href="/alternatives/klaviyo-alternative">Klaviyo</a> — The default benchmark for Shopify retention data depth.</li>
        <li><a class="link" href="/alternatives/omnisend-alternative">Omnisend</a> — Fast Shopify setup with pre-built ecommerce journeys.</li>
      </ul>
